{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1308,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63921bb81335a6ec41858203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……顺便收集一下衣服尺寸的数据好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9676dbc19f680745ee84e46f680eef494d68091cda5ca84f13743537d2fcfef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2c38507935574dd816e883",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "コメントは求めてませーん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46adb28a9ea70653031301533eaeac56d29c27ed071f5c82f6471e090bdb92d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2b8d295668d03832d34f6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スニーカー、\r\n一生足りねェ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c0e3108dea787b18f0642a91834fefe08808af646a61db355f09db6a104576a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d768d4179431493212de67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，算是蛮说得过去的设计？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07be2e4813e5bb46857a9bfd9fec223205d1e0ac391ce3a9a8a16ab3ee12fa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bccbe1e62bb121e941d175d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和这身衣服的风格唱反调的话才没效率吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f730b6aa0a59e2e8ce6b19b3bf36f508889140066e061396b697438a4a49bcf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42a96aec0ef4339564170f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是很吸睛的设计对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde0570d28d4159a8c7cd2647826122add4ea05e15ebe002d8d38c497bb78fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa6ef86f08dbb24cc25a650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "合不合身？马马虎虎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c2fc405d90d8c3d6264bc83dd2937ea80a084b92b66e0088b1db9c52cb7ad5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f31ba577713e67aa9e50d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啥啊，Live的排练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "edadd1f12e893e0d4acfa7043c469c59f098b3144a6cfab4ae50bf8fd8f9c3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01260157bed6dc861132ba92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你看到和推算相符的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d081bbdcb8a3cd86cad3a26662275e6b02be17294f14dfe43826f9d3c32bfd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9aff9594692b823b5faf9ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "デザインは精査してる。モチベが下がると\r\nパフォーマンスに影響すっからな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a5ae6da31c17a6bb9b57ef998be2d0d53e0e030928561e37218d38acd743e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfeec6ff6dd2d0bd0c24dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暗い場所で光るトリックについて？\r\nハ、教えるかよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1bd1710e6553701c2f364b3147920a01ff1a34365eafd8df383a1015f08043d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8baf139b8eadf04391f6a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管穿着什么去比赛，\r\n推算的结果都不会改变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c994871d7d9724ad761264176ab0e625e873bc06d9b2c7fa674c2a6a225a8273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f20cfdce37f42a75fcee19b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……顺便收集一下衣服尺寸的数据好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9676dbc19f680745ee84e46f680eef494d68091cda5ca84f13743537d2fcfef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4837dc1186ac983324b11706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88100019e070270fbcfe8464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シミュレーション通り、\r\nブチ抜いてやるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c4a466947e456d344f05df130f5c2e6176c67597cdb6f312e8f60d32ecf9bd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13e6358b4c41471153ca4a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オレのロジックを超えるってか？\r\n…はッ、甘ェんだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33858e3dc1fe3cd9a1cba29a4a4c2816ffac793c69a9a12b60ba4349f1da961d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb158757958bea2b50768cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯。\r\n什么啊，刚刚那句就是在对你说早上好了。\r\n排列语句什么的没必要吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be82c0b27da81fef839325610d7b29f33f496de06f0e3d04f88d9ddc420f159e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3989322fde3d4454960c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不会一大早就在那里\r\n优雅地吃着什么面包鸡蛋啊啥的。\r\n靠能量胶里的营养素就已经足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31100307cf9102dc2dadae51452d6fc405567118db24daabf2f7ec33cd2da530",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3547fc819f3cd7f4437c8e70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭我都是错开其他人吃饭的时间的……\r\n要是同一个时间段去的话会很吵的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47c20bbfca348b473303174c905e5c565d1356b0ec918e60cf8a3a12cb4e165b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7621ab3a456b2ab274e12175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠……\r\n为了下午的准备就稍微睡会儿吧。\r\n……别来吵我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd2e5043bec1966ec79a57fa7575dafa7fda62b2d8394b9c1fe53a30b57815b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc7b495bf2a80b1d558e51c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能一直都是晚上就好了。\r\n因为恼人的噪音很少，所以不容易分散注意力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9c4843697f4139204ae82d4b5fb18ee33be0561b1a2e009cbf0009953a187f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5698347dcae3be63542af3cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么啊，你还在干活啊？\r\n……嘛，晚上头脑更清醒这点我们倒是彼此彼此呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a11f954e8e2247aa3a41aac5a4285c5b27350de3542eb3566e51a2a736f592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcfd040d7f9aa8b04f34ecd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "负责带新生参观的啊……\r\n数据库也该更新了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a15ccb94098c40a9eb8ad4292d968ade0d8436a54f3338a7fa935a410007afc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce51af0bcdfc273bb70f89f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该死，蝉为什么那么吵啊？\r\n真是烦死我了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a56e36c2df08b9ae1053a103a7ac12e575e3beb478fc0af377ebda0e044430e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5f8402bfc0844229c9f8559",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在夏季好好锻炼过的那些家伙，\r\n眼神都变得越发锐利起来了呢。\r\n看来能得到些有趣的计算结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dbc908bf49becfa88b5f4c167a3d096f54673203e90bcd4009ab63e3d077d45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8324d5f08c57b4d56d6bebd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仿佛要把耳朵冻僵的空气……\r\n还不坏。……这样以来无论在哪\r\n都能够敏锐地思考了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d8830082a4a71c84ea555ee2bf21142cb6f747b1a5b91b812d1c19ae5b8f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef29d8628746b8cbe1d5d68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "セロトニンの必要量まで\r\nあと少し…ふあ――\r\nクソ眩しいが、しゃーねェ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd2afeccda34e9f36a6dac0720db14f7a0a421bdfc3709ab88bb0bb3d5afeae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48527d6cdc6854e350e4fd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝っぱらから元気なヤツの\r\n多いこって…ノイズのねェ場所は\r\nどこだ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "175318857bf0612d3591e31d03aa5974037b6333cf643aca9f247bb039836443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a347097e84799fab005ac6cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ン。\r\nまあまあシャキっとしてンな。\r\n悪くねェ。その調子でいけ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b002ee483e396ea5317e46132957ab105277f825d782fda0d0d299904fe39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f3ca2f6afb1fb04cafd75e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼メシ後に菓子を食うヤツの気が\r\n知れねえ。クソ甘ェし消化も遅え。\r\nメリットがねェだろ。…ア？味？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b972ddfbefffe524407f38a92aee88de5558999be622b0cdef250fbd7ad3ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb11299d62d5730944c1806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "周りのヤツらの気配が減った。\r\nさァて――こっからは\r\nオレの時間だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05485ec523c1b5f0a2d4c1537b5f22cead975518f9fe0e685d649a3af0bac4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72feb49eabf44295b2ece00d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜が楽なのは元からだ。\r\n悪魔の格好がどうだの、\r\n関係あるかっての。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6d1fc50750117f32af0e411d23088b69bc5f20f185ce20ab382f65cb5a6430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59359069966b0912b2f4cc6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "浮かれたヤツらも\r\nガン飛ばしゃ散っていく。ハ、\r\n視覚の効果ってのは確からしいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0fff78ce2a90ea351a0b5e83ffa4838eff2ca1481337d0a0b2d6abd91f359ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1975326322ac10f0a76beeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さすがに暑ィな…\r\nある程度パージできるよう\r\n設計しときゃよかったか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1295db621601861560331dd2fc7a52a7506167d3c9633fac0d1219a092cb2856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:204506534e807d3d7859cae3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やたら腹空かせたヤツが多いな…\r\nカボチャだのサツマイモだの、\r\nンな食いたくなるモンかね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e1dc6e5eaba65eba0aa33a8c683d66be6b709c864d4cddb75bf9cd8381b960",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13e6b522beb39b24a421d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒すぎンのはノイズだが、\r\n周りが大人しくなる分動きやすい。\r\n取れるデータ、全部取っとくか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc88eac8f59da2997611cdcb7efafcdf660e8032f1229da7f98e3a851836d02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36350b8a403b20592b0e7886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10be842037c4c5e3b6925dc8eb06c7f13f42ecf7834e14f3f08b64f735e80a63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4773e74cd9078302a137b744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10be842037c4c5e3b6925dc8eb06c7f13f42ecf7834e14f3f08b64f735e80a63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1504cddf3b2cf70ed4096152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是收集数据的话是没意义的。\r\n只有靠能够将数据跑起来的程序，\r\n它们才真正能发挥作用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a6b5333ca70529b528fb91742c3c60682f737f9b5a3993a560255dced02ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fa8a0876bd6777b8be7287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没打算刻意照顾，只是碰巧在场罢了……\r\n怒涛那家伙，今天也一直很冒失啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a400ba538d850b9c8780a99d86311416a7d2cfd1b1bef6b8bec2f9a53c698eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0cd972c3689ebc02921e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "茶座那家伙，愿意给我泡咖啡倒是挺好的……\r\n但不要引发一些无法用逻辑解释的现象啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "634bdbd67a6c55ef5e3dd9993852b29bb08b08040bb8b3a80c81a1c208e37df3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c546e15e86b8d19f164bb84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没什么比电子游戏还要简单的娱乐方式了吧。\r\n只要能够理解那些由数字规则\r\n所构成的逻辑就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f55bc3dae9f0d40e11b846c39d25eada8ebc5547fd9525623b868a366e1999f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b739477cee798a0038f60e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……四叶草就是那个吧。\r\n无论什么时候都不会枯萎……\r\n真是坚毅啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6736af240edf426cbc1bf3d3a08441f1a2275197568fd76945fab25185df585a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1e33cf2976d7a43917200c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然看起来只是轻飘飘的，\r\n但是也考虑到了如何让裙子在摆动时显得最优美呢……\r\n真佩服啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abaae6947a95b697e2a973d03e12673ce964002836cd5fa65234d91a64b9affc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d07ca07a37d63c86dedd6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的布料，\r\n是特地为了能让穿着者在Live上\r\n展现出最佳的表演效果而开发的。\r\n……还不错嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d0e9e123618ead0094b6b9d4f22ac90bbd1d12b13482e818aed513604ae8cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab7530657fc2ac05d6a67122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“意外地很张扬”？\r\n我只是在委托他们设计的时候，\r\n把想到了的部分告诉了那边而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5b7ca34e7d14280214315e84ed8074cefb146da86c93388d0f4ada4f389f0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a8b4c0ed89e70d7cae8859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上后能拿出干劲也很重要吧？\r\n心情的好坏，当然也作为数据输入进程序内了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a95fd06a051b09f1d927c7ce1af90d29ae06f29f87e5b9742ebc3edf71ffe47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09eeff51a1eb31f9f1753d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……\r\n有事的话之后再说。\r\n大清早就在那唠唠叨叨的是吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "729261b2729d7dc6a80dc492a377c2c8e58223a179032d4ede0debe1ce886af9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96af0f482943d6b90997e41b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美妙她说什么“休息也是很重要的”，\r\n又跑来找我闲聊了……\r\n明明昨天就已经和她聊过了啊，真是的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2afc58e4fce7d5b4ada162b75b23617fe99b459a08f7f68fe9ce9f09f6054b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843bdc46261a12de23c0a7de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哼，昨晚上传的曲子，\r\n还蛮多人听的嘛。\r\n一晚上就涨了不少播放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5886eaa60ae125996b8aa5207e4f6e0da4c135694954d2e93cc38a32a427c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac032b1879ac6e096bae28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～……呆。\r\n果然还是喜欢不起来啊，这种放松的空气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9100ea0fa69017b45e40a981aa354cbca33b5e7191fae56087f93f6016a3ab6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6c0f4a0e81877bdb2d039e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，热得都没法好好思考了。\r\n在变得像过热的电脑一样之前，\r\n吃根冰棍给脑袋降降温吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ea6db3fd5da44187ef11e3c630fb899d9c2a86e41f4f4468facf8208528790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcafb9b36e4c93fd3329fe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……白天也变得越来越短了啊，\r\n如果要训练的话记得提高效率哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0209a27b15e0142bddcc48125b5c2de6e203d662037049c706a71d5f528f6116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc1526b6fd038e08cec5d14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要气温降低的话，\r\n就能够抑制体温的上升。\r\n很适合跑步啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ba8c348e353489f2f3aa0495611a8c249bad0a735770f9fb09baa2c1451cab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f73483d69ca2a18c7cb91d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "5秒で終わる会話をギムレットは\r\n平均17.6秒かけやがる…ハァ、\r\n翻訳アプリでもありゃあな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c1c2042051e2d7860493f1d6d168876029955d172d145e382b6db25a4d63678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e060c096ac8a26c349db0ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ったく、クローバーの写真\r\n送るのは勝手だが、データくらい\r\n軽量化しとけっての。",
      "source_fingerprint": "402a77e6dfa2fe574f603b78db67489a0bcdf883ae86eba791a7e4e576a5a31f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377e8f4e67b8fd1ab72c437b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自分に都合の悪ィモンを『悪魔』\r\nと呼ンだって説もある。ハ、\r\nいつの時代も変わらねェもンだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3122dbf0eab73dea0eca607e0a92389764ba61c12b7040268f622d1b265152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:178416649426075627c72333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "霊が帰ってくるとかおとぎ話かよ。\r\nロジカルじゃねえ。\r\n…怖がってる？ハ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fad7dad28a67162ec0f7456aca7749501ce305d21013f716ea3fac1709140d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7240f96f895892579814b544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエスのヤツは、さすがに\r\nもうちっと喋らねェモンかね…\r\n取れるデータも取りづれェ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e680f9450d92cd82978689376c99263337bbe7353bbbd930c40628236d102d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f4171b320e85898483f07e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "またドトウのドジで目が覚めた…\r\nアイツはある意味、\r\n悪魔より強ェかもな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb98534c3cc6d75f3016f40d220a41d481bf03a38007bd0e8eb9e73c642802f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e304a213a45551ee44c45453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くあ…眠気が来たか。\r\n予測どおりのタイミングだ。\r\n寝られる場所、探すか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb506a501ca81a9026e05f4cf615214343107119459731f2adc68b7af97abf59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269de648565284ab866ad47c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間も気にしとくか。消灯されると\r\nメンドくせェからな。…暗いと\r\nなンか出そう？…バカじゃねェの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2177921a0e80098a707f170c2ee3cac5313b1fa3b52a3908a8a39eb5ebffd8cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fa55f1c8b36f1bb0af0990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タップの鼻歌が頭から離れねェ…！\r\nチッ、春だからって\r\n浮かれやがって…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c020d4f2c91c3c3fcdc7ba97105ac2b15d38ace0b715a7789609de898f9b07fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b476d6a140d3ea526a83b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒い地獄もあるらしいな。\r\nこンな日にゃ覗いてみるのも――\r\n…いや、ロジカルじゃねェな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75552f41cf777f0a750c61fb8296d09213ecc706990f09892731e59d4dfc4408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa736575780bb50073a67e75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クソッ、なンでこンなに菓子を\r\n渡してくるヤツが多いンだ！？\r\n格好のせいか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42bb6b042861ff71a22c608baeeeb25dd3c60960912f8b46c078bd6a7357e7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd34d642912fcbd1f340475",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンだよ、震えてやがンのか？\r\n気温の影響考えてねェからだ――\r\nヘクシュ！ッ、今のは…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b528c89d3f3b6f9efaaa52b10414721bbc1acdb9ead75b11e3641f4fb01c5367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106820fddf37c023bfc88369",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悪魔ってモン自体は荒唐無稽だが、\r\nイメージは悪かねェ。\r\n獰猛、邪悪…ハ、歓迎だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2085f9c56d5da6ca6939a43ef795c7318f011b17ebe575b2c019afc2f190f9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eba5ec29c21d9f567b756ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鎖の音は不思議と\r\nノイズにならねェな。\r\n…鋭く澄ンで、耳に馴染む。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2a03c2c8beb3fc07761b8a011bd082043b13284241025d2818bebe042b711c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e79f8e2b9d939f78cb40c69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，别慢吞吞的，倒是考虑一下训练效率啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad86044b00f45717677e23734a90ea06e554e3d864c233d35424230f6e7c1ad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57da617aace0cff9f9b46e42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "685df70aed66b450dda4ca765d7d7a8dbba9bec231e18dec24c1e7e489d89563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d2a414e7609010ab3bea50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我训练的话我就训练，\r\n要我休息的话我就休息。\r\n不管选哪边结果都就推算完毕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b256ac3027c4fb38e0ddbdf6f2621dde24330faaf91fe21c34a64ad74b2ec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba1d67c45907e444f16e247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“把能提高的数值好好提高起来”。\r\n这也在计算之内。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9293259064e3d666d0914d75f525c28bc71c689406af9c743696dee0b6d53be8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8823f483af5719f1ccda320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气势……？\r\n哈啊，真是毫无逻辑的词啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173c9cd34e82a031f126906edad2038b63b41e5f70b6ecd227d51793f39a8956",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8544558a7aebfad6f3c480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可是零件。\r\n事到如今要是还有缺陷的话我可饶不了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4646c6975b7348f00fa3e48f618af1f1b75eedb26b9d0068901874dacd81373c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b593789903a12b8b81461fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你这不是已经可以逻辑地思考了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d50f87eece3395d2677341ead6afe91694c104c33f6c048ae0fe32355f97a903",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfaf8845c1762bb892057f98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没打算让你理解我。\r\n也没打算对你让步……\r\n明明知道是这样，真亏你还会往我这来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73b74999717478c27378ca5e4198172cbdca4b9ff252a75fa6eceedb045c412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd7c72e5f871474554528b9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是提升想要加强的部分，\r\n还是说重点锻炼不足的地方都无所谓。\r\n高效地开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07b9fdb8b685ef633d3fb909552d4d5eaf753f19a54cab053d765f08fb198df4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1908233cd5ceaa478242b685",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さァて――\r\n地獄への旅、始めっか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76f3649805dba2eba10faccc1711b41dfb19c0c1b0ff24d20cdca80165193d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d4a18c32fdabdad229f418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースで白黒ハッキリつける。\r\nそのためのデータ収集だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed654d5e0f8d1e5bbd3bd1a74a6b8b055a2a120ae6228eee8bf23a4012805200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daceae6d48b5079fab934d64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お前の知恵も力も、\r\n貪欲に利用してやるさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc8da9755cb734298253cd15baefbb87f7b6130fee09d6681c37e7c2f1e1aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
